### Description



@fig-gapminder shows the relationship between GDP per capita and life expectancy
for a total of 142 countries. 
For this set of countries, economic wealth ranged from a minimum of USD $312 to a maximum of USD $41\,283 per capita.

|Summary of Data|  |
|------|------|
|Number of Countries|142|
|Minimum GDP per capita|$312|
|Maximum GDP per capita|$41\,283|


